tSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sessions","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionEventKind","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEventKind","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Sessions16SessionEventKindO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> = Set(SessionEventKind.allCases), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"file","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#file","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#fileID","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"function","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#line","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"column","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#column","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NonPositiveSessionTimeout","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/NonPositiveSessionTimeout","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Sessions25NonPositiveSessionTimeoutV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The inactivity after which the next event starts a new session.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"timeout"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The session events to track; both by default. Leaving one out, or both, tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none of that kind, and every record still carries its session’s key.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"kinds"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"file"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"fileID"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"function"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"line"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default."}]}],"name":"column"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is put in a session until the app turns it on, among the enrichers it builds its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApplicationOpened"},{"text":" (module","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LifecycleTracking"},{"text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference"},{"text":" comes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference"},{"text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference"},{"text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session ends with no ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","type":"reference"},{"text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A session’s identifier is a version 7 UUID: the session’s start in Unix milliseconds, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"random bits, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. It is held in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this enricher’s memory and nowhere else: neither a store nor anything else writes it to disk,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a new enricher, as on the next launch, starts with a new session. Records a store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kept from an earlier run aren’t enriched again, so they carry no key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher’s sessions are its own, created by this call: give each tracker its own call."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/NonPositiveSessionTimeout","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timeout"},{"type":"text","text":" is zero or less."}]}],"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/Events","doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/Events\/Enricher"]]},"references":{"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/SessionEnded/duration":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time from the session’s first event to its last; zero for a session of one event."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded\/duration","url":"\/documentation\/sessions\/sessionended\/duration","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"duration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"duration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Enricher","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/SessionStarted":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionStarted","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SessionStarted","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","url":"\/documentation\/sessions\/sessionstarted","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SessionStarted","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A session started: what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks before the first event of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each session, stamped with that event’s time and carrying the new session’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/SessionEnded":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SessionEnded","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A session ended, having lasted "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded\/duration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": what "},{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when an event comes after the timeout’s inactivity, before the next session’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","url":"\/documentation\/sessions\/sessionended","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"SessionEnded","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionEnded","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/NonPositiveSessionTimeout":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/NonPositiveSessionTimeout","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The error "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)"},{"type":"text","text":" throws for a timeout of zero or less."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NonPositiveSessionTimeout"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NonPositiveSessionTimeout"}],"title":"NonPositiveSessionTimeout","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/sessions\/nonpositivesessiontimeout"},"doc://Sessions/documentation/Sessions/Events/Enricher":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"}],"kind":"symbol","ti